+// <exe>\cache, installed LocalAppData\F1-06\cache, development next to the runner) before creating the device; the
+// DLL only uses it on the GPU and driver it was saved on. It is saved again when the driver's cache grew, by a thread
+// of its own that looks every 10 s: once it stopped growing (or every minute while it keeps growing), so that a crash
